---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout title="Nursery — The Forktree Project" description="The Forktree Project's on-site native plant nursery propagates locally provenanced species for habitat restoration across the Hills and Fleurieu region.">

  <!-- Hero / Intro -->
  <section class="nur-section nur-section--hero" style="background-image: url('/images/nursery/img_4232.jpg'); background-color: #2a3a2a;">
    <div class="nur-section__content nur-section__content--center">
      <div class="nur-text nur-text--wide">
        <h1>The Forktree Project Nursery</h1>

        <div class="nur-body">
          <p>Supporting the region&rsquo;s biodiversity revival.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Supporting Regional Rewilding -->
  <section class="nur-section nur-section--plain">
    <p class="nur-kicker">Nursery</p>
    <div class="nur-intro">
      <p class="nur-intro__lead">Supporting Regional Rewilding</p>
      <p class="nur-intro__body">The Forktree Project Nursery grows a wide range of endemic native species to meet the needs of a variety of planting projects, including:</p>
      <ul class="nur-list nur-list--plain">
        <li>large&#8209;scale habitat restoration and conservation projects</li>
        <li>private landholders looking to restore ecological health on their properties</li>
        <li>our own restoration program on the Forktree Project site itself</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="nur-intro__body">We are proud to have grown over 75,000 plants of over 175 different species in the nursery this year.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Restoration-led Provenance -->
  <section class="nur-section nur-section--olive">
    <p class="nur-kicker nur-kicker--light">Provenance</p>
    <div class="nur-intro">
      <p class="nur-intro__lead nur-intro__lead--light">Restoration-led Provenance</p>
      <p class="nur-intro__body nur-intro__body--light">All plants in The Forktree Project Nursery are grown from seed and plant material of carefully selected provenance to ensure long-term ecological resilience in their destination sites.</p>
      <p class="nur-intro__body nur-intro__body--light">Seed and plant materials are responsibly collected by the Forktree Nursery team from a range of sources, including:</p>
      <ul class="nur-list nur-list--olive">
        <li>our own Rare Seed Orchard</li>
        <li>the wider property itself (both remnant vegetation and maturing restoration plants)</li>
        <li>partner sites</li>
        <li>trusted local suppliers</li>
        <li>the South Australian Seed Conservation Centre</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Guided by ecological knowledge -->
  <section class="nur-section nur-section--plain">
    <p class="nur-kicker">Advice</p>
    <div class="nur-intro">
      <p class="nur-intro__lead">Guided by ecological knowledge</p>
      <p class="nur-intro__body">We work closely with clients to advise on species best suited to their site, drawing on our team&rsquo;s extensive knowledge of local flora and best-practice restoration methods.</p>
      <p class="nur-intro__body">To discuss your habitat restoration needs, please contact us at <a href="mailto:nursery@theforktreeproject.com">nursery@theforktreeproject.com</a>. We&rsquo;d love to work with you.</p>
      <div class="nur-cta">
        <a href="mailto:nursery@theforktreeproject.com" class="btn--cta btn--cta-lg btn--cta-dark">Get in Touch</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</PageLayout>

<style>
  .nur-section {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    background-attachment: scroll;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .nur-section::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 50% at 50% 45%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35) 0%, transparent 100%),
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .nur-section--plain {
    background: #fafaf9;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    min-height: auto;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .nur-section--plain::before {
    display: none;
  }

  .nur-section--olive {
    background: #1f2a1f;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    min-height: auto;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .nur-section--olive::before {
    display: none;
  }

  .nur-kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0;
    padding: 80px 60px 0;
  }

  .nur-kicker--light {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
  }

  .nur-intro {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 40px 60px 80px;
  }

  .nur-intro__lead {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.5vw, 2.2rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .nur-intro__lead--light {
    color: #fff;
  }

  .nur-intro__body {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.3vw, 1.1rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #444;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .nur-intro__body--light {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
  }

  .nur-intro__body a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .nur-intro__body a:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .nur-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0.5rem auto 1.5rem;
    text-align: left;
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .nur-list li {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.3vw, 1.1rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .nur-list li::before {
    content: '\2022';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
  }

  .nur-list--plain li {
    color: #444;
  }

  .nur-list--plain li::before {
    color: #00A651;
  }

  .nur-list--olive li {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
  }

  .nur-list--olive li::before {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
  }

  .nur-section__content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1600px;
    padding: 180px 100px;
  }

  .nur-section__content--center {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .nur-text {
    max-width: 50%;
    position: relative;
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    text-shadow: 0 1px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7), 0 0 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
  }

  .nur-text--wide {
    max-width: 65%;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .nur-text h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .nur-body p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 1.8vw, 1.3rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .nur-body a {
    color: white;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .nur-cta {
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
  }

  .btn--cta {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 1.2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: white;
    border: 2px solid white;
    padding: 13px 26px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all var(--transition-normal);
  }

  .btn--cta:hover {
    background-color: white;
    color: #000;
  }

  .btn--cta-lg {
    font-size: 14px;
    padding: 18px 40px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
  }

  .btn--cta-dark {
    color: #1a1a1a;
    border-color: #1a1a1a;
  }

  .btn--cta-dark:hover {
    background-color: #1a1a1a;
    color: white;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .nur-section {
      background-attachment: scroll;
      min-height: auto;
    }

    .nur-section__content {
      padding: 100px 30px;
    }

    .nur-text,
    .nur-text--wide {
      max-width: 100%;
    }

    .nur-intro {
      padding: 30px 30px 60px;
    }

    .nur-kicker {
      padding: 60px 30px 0;
    }
  }
</style>
